      "id": "s4",
      "text": "The firefly's light flickered, growing dim and soft like a dying ember. Mosk's whiskers trembled as he remembered the winter he failed her, his heart heavy with the weight of that old mistake. He stayed close, watching the mossy bed where his once-dear friend lay, waiting to see if a new chance might finally arrive."
    },
    {
